        <mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the total summed over the join, 1.85 times the header total, because each invoice&#x27;s GrandTotal repeats on every one of its lines. The pane shows one result: DB Browser keeps only the last statement&#x27;s grid, so the two totals are returned by one query.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="460" width="860" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
